<title>USA: Sybron Chemicals names Dennis Fiore CFO.</title>
<headline>Sybron Chemicals names Dennis Fiore CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, N.J. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sybron Chemicals Inc said Monday it named Dennis Fiore as vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The position has been vacant since 1996.</p>
<p>Fiore, 46, is currently vice president, finance/chief financial officer of InterMetro Industries, a manufacturer of storage systems.</p>
